<title>CHINA: Trading in Benelux shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Benelux shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Benelux International Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Shares of the data storage products maker jumped HK$0.105 or 21.65 percent to HK$0.59 on Friday on volume of 1.095 billion shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
